### Stop retrying when Reload never finishes loading

**Severity:** `medium`

If Reload does not restore the loaded state, this helper should stop rather than spend another row-count timeout against an unloaded window. Check the load result and return `false` immediately; the next row-count attempt is valid only after a successful load.

```suggestion
            if (!WaitForLoaded(ui, timeoutMS: 30_000))
            {
                return false;
            }
```
